'''Archon Quests''' are [[Quest]]s that tell the main story of the [[Traveler]] and [[Paimon]] as they travel the world of [[Teyvat]] in search of the Traveler's [[Traveler's Sibling|lost sibling]]. Players need to reach a certain [[Adventure Rank]] (AR) to unlock each Act in this storyline.

The difficulty of enemies in Archon Quests as well as the level of trial characters (up to 90) is calculated based on current [[World Level]].

==List of Archon Quests==
